# 🚀 Enterprise Retail Lakehouse Platform

An end-to-end **Data Engineering** project that simulates a modern retail data platform using **PySpark**, **Delta Lake**, and the **Medallion Architecture (Bronze → Silver → Gold)**.

The project demonstrates how raw operational data can be transformed into analytics-ready datasets using scalable ETL pipelines and dimensional data modeling.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

Retail businesses generate data from multiple operational systems such as customer management, product catalogs, inventory systems, and order management systems.

This project simulates those source systems and builds a complete **Lakehouse ETL pipeline** that:

* Generates realistic retail datasets
* Ingests raw data into a Bronze Layer
* Cleans and validates data in a Silver Layer
* Builds analytical Star Schema tables in the Gold Layer

The final datasets are designed to support reporting and business intelligence tools.

---

# 🏗️ Architecture

```text
                Source Systems
                       │
                       ▼
             Generated CSV Files
                       │
                       ▼
            Bronze Layer (Delta Lake)
             Raw Data Ingestion
                       │
                       ▼
           Silver Layer (Delta Lake)
      Data Cleaning & Validation
                       │
                       ▼
            Gold Layer (Delta Lake)
        Star Schema & Business Metrics
                       │
                       ▼
          Analytics / Data Warehouse
```

